WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.230
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.240 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.870 --> 01:15.070
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.010 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.350 --> 01:24.080
...is often called this...

01:24.150 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:32.230 --> 01:34.490
Yoshiki Futami, age 33.

01:34.560 --> 01:38.550
My birthday is June 30th, 1973.

01:39.170 --> 01:42.900
Right now, I belong
to Ark Corporation.

01:43.040 --> 01:43.900
Ark...

01:44.500 --> 01:49.340
I weaved between the CEO's
mind and decided to record this.

01:49.580 --> 01:51.870
The abnormality that
has happened to me...

02:00.290 --> 02:01.550
<i>Ark</i>

02:01.550 --> 02:05.320
<i>Ark
Episode 18</i>

02:18.400 --> 02:19.770
Mr. Futami?

02:27.050 --> 02:31.110
My mind is past the paradox
and is reacting to this monitor.

02:31.650 --> 02:35.310
The abnormality of my body
started when I was in college.

02:35.590 --> 02:38.820
I was able to see the girl that
I was dating through the phone.

02:40.260 --> 02:42.320
That color doesn't look good on you.

02:43.430 --> 02:45.420
I told myself it was only my imagination...

02:45.500 --> 02:48.430
That it wasn't possible...
But I was wrong.

02:49.470 --> 02:53.030
The next time I was able to see her
through the phone, she was naked.

02:53.210 --> 02:57.110
And I was able to see the face of
the guy sleeping next to her clearly.

02:57.180 --> 02:59.440
It was a guy that called me his friend.

02:59.880 --> 03:03.340
It was a huge shock, but I was more
stunned by my ability than anything.

03:03.980 --> 03:08.080
It was fun for a while because
there wasn't anything I couldn't see.

03:08.220 --> 03:10.280
It helped me a lot for work too.

03:10.860 --> 03:13.220
But I wasn't able to
love anyone anymore.

03:13.390 --> 03:15.220
Until I met Natsuko...

03:15.800 --> 03:19.230
Natsuko revived my heart
that was totally dried up.

03:20.870 --> 03:23.890
That was when Ark's
staff came to scout me.

03:24.440 --> 03:27.500
No one is supposed to
know about my powers.

03:28.110 --> 03:30.510
Three years ago, I entered Ark.

03:30.840 --> 03:33.540
The job collecting
data was worth doing.

03:33.980 --> 03:37.970
My ability became stronger
with the special training.

03:38.350 --> 03:42.880
I put my mind to any network and
flew around within the network freely.

03:44.020 --> 03:46.890
But my power
advanced too much, and...

03:46.960 --> 03:49.660
...I started seeing
things that I didn't have to.

04:00.170 --> 04:01.070
Brother!

04:01.910 --> 04:05.370
Apparently, Ark didn't want
the two of us getting in contact.

04:05.750 --> 04:09.840
They set up numerous traps and I
couldn't get close to her information.

04:09.980 --> 04:13.540
Since then, I learned to have
doubt and suspicion regarding Ark.

04:13.750 --> 04:16.220
At the same time,
I feel obscure danger too.

04:16.290 --> 04:18.880
Regardless, I've decided
to start recording...

04:18.960 --> 04:19.760
Mr. Futami?

04:19.760 --> 04:20.590
Mr. Futami?
Someone's coming.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.610
You are...

04:40.680 --> 04:41.940
He says to come with him.

04:42.010 --> 04:43.000
What?

04:43.180 --> 04:45.650
He's saying they want to invite us.

04:46.120 --> 04:47.920
If you resist, the woman...

04:48.720 --> 04:50.780
...I cannot guarantee
the woman's life.

04:50.860 --> 04:52.020
What did you say?

04:58.330 --> 05:00.320
No!

05:01.130 --> 05:03.100
We have no choice
but to go, Brother.

05:03.170 --> 05:05.300
They have the car waiting out front.

05:05.370 --> 05:06.400
Damn it...

05:42.740 --> 05:44.210
Excuse me.

05:47.710 --> 05:51.980
Please don't think I regularly
have my meal in a meeting room.

05:52.420 --> 05:54.250
I didn't have time.

05:54.690 --> 05:56.480
Why are you interfering with us?

05:56.560 --> 05:57.490
Interfering?

05:57.890 --> 05:59.720
Interfering, huh?

05:59.790 --> 06:02.320
It sounds so arbitrary...

06:02.400 --> 06:04.630
Are you saying it's not arbitrary?

06:10.770 --> 06:13.930
The director, Akiko Okuhara,
has the power of foresight.

06:14.140 --> 06:17.600
She used that power to
make this company this big.

06:17.680 --> 06:21.010
She also put a lot of work
into the network's development.

06:21.080 --> 06:23.510
The result is obvious.

06:23.620 --> 06:26.880
Nowadays, she is connected with
the political world in a great way.

06:27.190 --> 06:30.750
They are in need of
Okuhara's powers.

06:30.860 --> 06:32.220
What's your objective?

06:35.390 --> 06:40.590
There are often stories of using
psychic powers to take over the world...

06:40.670 --> 06:42.160
...but those are lies.

06:42.230 --> 06:47.570
Human ambitions are born especially
when you do not know the result.

06:47.640 --> 06:49.540
I'm asking what your objective is!

06:49.680 --> 06:52.040
Mankind is moving
toward destruction.

06:52.510 --> 06:55.380
The director is trying to
prevent that from happening.

06:55.450 --> 06:57.920
Those that are trying
to commit the mistake...

06:57.980 --> 07:00.080
...are calling the
destruction reformation.

07:00.150 --> 07:02.420
The reformation and the destruction
are supposed to be different!

07:02.490 --> 07:04.220
If the materialistic
civilization becomes nothing...

07:04.290 --> 07:07.260
...then that will mean
destruction to many people.

07:07.330 --> 07:08.260
No!

07:08.330 --> 07:10.630
Mankind is not moving
toward destruction!

07:10.700 --> 07:12.930
In this world, authority and assets...

07:13.000 --> 07:15.130
...are all constructed
on top of materialistic things.

07:15.200 --> 07:19.000
There are many people
afraid of that value collapsing.

07:19.740 --> 07:24.370
For those people, the collapse of the
materialistic civilization is destruction.

07:24.440 --> 07:27.940
If people keep on ignoring
the existence of mind energy...

07:28.010 --> 07:30.880
...and keep on turning their
hearts toward the negative...

07:30.950 --> 07:32.380
...that's when the
destruction will occur.

07:32.450 --> 07:34.040
Attachment to the
materialistic civilization is...

07:34.120 --> 07:38.060
...the biggest reason why people are
turning their thoughts toward the negative!

07:38.260 --> 07:39.950
If it's someone with
great power of foresight...

07:40.030 --> 07:41.760
...they should have
been able to see that far!

07:41.830 --> 07:43.290
Then why!

07:43.360 --> 07:46.700
The collapse of the materialistic
civilization itself is destruction.

07:46.770 --> 07:50.290
Being fixated to the materialistic
civilization brings along destruction!

07:54.070 --> 07:56.170
You continue with
the values of this era...

07:56.240 --> 07:58.570
...and bring it as far as
possible from destruction.

07:58.640 --> 08:00.580
That's the right choice.

08:01.080 --> 08:02.210
This is wrong!

08:02.280 --> 08:05.480
You guys are aware of
the existence of mind energy...

08:05.550 --> 08:08.710
...but why do you try to adhere
to the materialistic civilization?

08:08.920 --> 08:12.820
Why do we have to tell
those that don't believe it?

08:12.890 --> 08:16.620
Those that know the
truth should just evolve.

08:17.300 --> 08:20.230
Most of mankind is
the hundredth monkey.

08:20.700 --> 08:26.230
If the other 99 monkeys won't
change their thoughts, they won't either.

08:27.410 --> 08:30.340
Monkeys like that are
crawling all over this world.

08:30.910 --> 08:33.540
You just have to
leave them as they are.

08:33.610 --> 08:36.600
You think something like that is
going to be reason for murder?

08:36.680 --> 08:40.850
It's only a small sacrifice to
send everyone on the right way.

08:41.090 --> 08:42.550
That's just a play on words!

08:43.860 --> 08:46.920
Everyone is changing
a little at a time!

08:47.330 --> 08:50.300
No one will be able to stop that flow!

08:50.360 --> 08:53.390
Isn't that power to
watch over that flow?

08:54.930 --> 08:55.800
Excuse me.

09:12.050 --> 09:13.580
It's me. What is it?

09:13.650 --> 09:14.740
Brother!

09:14.820 --> 09:18.050
Mr. Futami is being kept captive
somewhere in this building.

09:18.120 --> 09:18.950
What!

09:22.930 --> 09:24.930
<i>Naoto Kirihara</i>

09:24.930 --> 09:27.160
<i>Naoto Kirihara
Naoya Kirihara</i>

09:27.700 --> 09:29.630
<i>Elimination</i>

09:31.500 --> 09:34.300
I understand.
Please take care of that.

09:35.510 --> 09:36.500
Hello?

09:37.840 --> 09:38.900
Huh?

09:38.980 --> 09:43.310
Seeing that it's brighter outside,
seems like the lights went out in this room.

09:43.380 --> 09:46.720
Two at the same time makes
me feel something like a hint.

09:46.890 --> 09:49.120
What kind of power do you have?

09:49.420 --> 09:51.890
Let's just say it's a reaction ability.

09:51.960 --> 09:52.950
What?

09:53.130 --> 09:55.960
The power to neutralize
the effect of an ability.

09:56.130 --> 10:00.160
I don't have to worry about having
my body hurt or my thoughts read.

10:00.230 --> 10:04.460
There isn't anyone better than
myself to meet with you guys.

10:04.540 --> 10:07.700
I should start becoming
busier from here on.

10:07.770 --> 10:11.800
There are many unawakened people
with supernatural powers in this world.

10:12.110 --> 10:15.640
And this company is the
only window for these people.

10:16.120 --> 10:20.520
We want to give you help.
That's our feeling.

10:20.590 --> 10:24.020
We never want to have anything
to do with you guys ever again! Never!

10:24.090 --> 10:27.790
I guess we couldn't get
our thoughts to join together.

10:28.030 --> 10:29.020
How disappointing...

10:29.500 --> 10:31.860
But it was good to be able to meet.

10:31.930 --> 10:33.830
It was worthwhile.

10:34.070 --> 10:36.760
You invited us here
pretty much by threatening us!

10:36.970 --> 10:38.900
It seems like there are
a lot of misunderstandings.

10:38.970 --> 10:42.100
I hope there will be a time
I get to explain it to you.

10:42.170 --> 10:43.140
Why you...

10:43.380 --> 10:45.570
Your way home is dangerous.

10:45.640 --> 10:47.640
Please be careful leaving.

10:47.710 --> 10:49.040
Good-bye.

10:51.680 --> 10:52.670
Brother...

10:52.750 --> 10:53.980
Yeah, I feel it.

10:54.650 --> 10:56.380
It's a strong intent to kill.

11:01.130 --> 11:01.990
Those guys!

11:02.060 --> 11:04.500
The ones that were waiting
at the forest by the laboratory!

11:04.560 --> 11:07.590
This isn't an energy
spot like that time!

11:07.670 --> 11:10.430
There are no advantages for you!

11:11.570 --> 11:13.270
Piece of cake, huh?

11:13.610 --> 11:15.200
Can we win?

11:15.270 --> 11:18.730
I don't know. But there isn't
any kind of fear like last time.

11:18.910 --> 11:19.810
Okay!

11:36.530 --> 11:37.790
There's no way...

11:39.900 --> 11:42.390
Let's get this done with...

11:43.740 --> 11:44.790
Sand?

11:46.170 --> 11:47.430
What the hell is this!

11:47.970 --> 11:48.910
What is it?

11:52.950 --> 11:53.840
Naoya!

12:14.500 --> 12:16.660
What happened, Naoya?

12:16.800 --> 12:17.790
It's Shouko.

12:17.870 --> 12:20.360
She sent us here.

12:20.540 --> 12:21.670
Shouko did?

12:21.810 --> 12:22.670
Yeah.

12:23.180 --> 12:24.900
Where is this place?

12:25.010 --> 12:26.200
I don't know.

12:26.810 --> 12:28.440
The past or the future...

12:28.510 --> 12:30.380
I've been here once in a dream.

12:33.720 --> 12:37.590
Are Shouko's powers
getting greater little by little?

12:38.190 --> 12:39.050
They're coming!

12:45.970 --> 12:47.630
Stay back, Naoya.

12:48.030 --> 12:49.430
No, I'm fine.

12:50.570 --> 12:52.590
Well don't you use
an interesting power!

12:52.670 --> 12:55.070
Even if you run, it's useless!

12:55.140 --> 12:57.130
The future is already decided!

13:08.350 --> 13:09.340
Damn it...

13:09.420 --> 13:10.480
I'm going first!

13:19.130 --> 13:20.360
Leave it to me!

13:33.150 --> 13:34.370
How could it...

13:45.060 --> 13:46.020
Damn it...

13:47.190 --> 13:49.060
Is this place an energy spot too?

13:49.130 --> 13:50.760
There's no way!

13:50.900 --> 13:51.890
Then why!

13:51.960 --> 13:53.090
Don't be flustered!

13:53.270 --> 13:54.660
We are going to win!

13:54.800 --> 13:56.770
That's what the director foresaw!

13:56.900 --> 13:59.600
The director saw the future!
There is no mistake!

13:59.840 --> 14:01.360
Combine our powers!

14:01.440 --> 14:02.530
Okay!

14:02.710 --> 14:04.140
This time we'll definitely get them!

14:13.850 --> 14:14.820
Why!

14:15.150 --> 14:16.820
What are they!

14:18.560 --> 14:19.620
Brother!

14:54.390 --> 14:57.190
If I hadn't done it,
they would have gotten us.

14:57.800 --> 14:58.920
Yeah, I know.

14:59.400 --> 15:02.490
But, then we're the same as them.

15:03.540 --> 15:08.000
Even Ark knows that fighting
only gives birth to tragedy.

15:09.410 --> 15:15.010
But Ark gave birth to those
that can't live without fighting.

15:15.310 --> 15:18.280
If we let something like this
continue, the destruction will come...

15:18.420 --> 15:19.210
...for sure!

15:19.850 --> 15:21.650
I know that much, but...

15:21.820 --> 15:22.810
I...

15:22.920 --> 15:24.620
I can't do anything!

15:27.190 --> 15:28.750
Don't get so worried on your own.

15:28.890 --> 15:29.860
Brother...

15:41.010 --> 15:42.100
Shouko!

15:48.780 --> 15:50.150
I can finally touch you...

15:58.660 --> 16:00.390
I can't see you anymore...

16:00.990 --> 16:02.190
I'm sorry...

16:02.290 --> 16:04.660
I can't hold this shape anymore...

16:04.930 --> 16:06.590
Are you going to another world?

16:06.670 --> 16:07.460
Yeah...

16:08.000 --> 16:10.030
I won't be able to
touch you anymore.

16:10.700 --> 16:14.970
Though I will be really far,
I will be really close to you too.

16:15.370 --> 16:19.210
There was a lot
I wanted you to teach me.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.470
It's okay.

16:20.550 --> 16:24.980
Mr. Yoshiki Futami is going to stay in
this world in a different form than myself.

16:25.880 --> 16:29.180
Just now, he left for that place.

16:29.320 --> 16:33.120
He left a message for
you two in the original world.

16:35.260 --> 16:37.160
Are you leaving already?

16:39.360 --> 16:41.200
I'm glad I got to know you.

16:46.270 --> 16:47.500
Mr. Naoto...

16:49.940 --> 16:53.400
Please don't stare into the
darkness in your heart so much.

16:53.610 --> 16:57.310
You have the strength
to overcome that trial.

16:58.250 --> 16:59.550
Strength?

17:07.560 --> 17:08.820
Don't forget...

17:09.260 --> 17:12.790
Even if destruction doesn't happen,
the reformation will come.

17:13.170 --> 17:15.330
There is still something
the two of you can do.

17:51.570 --> 17:52.660
This place is...

17:52.840 --> 17:54.400
We're back...

17:55.570 --> 17:56.730
Shouko...

17:58.910 --> 17:59.740
This is...

17:59.810 --> 18:02.610
Mr. Futami's message that
Shouko was talking about!

18:51.900 --> 18:52.890
Is that Futami?

18:52.960 --> 18:56.330
No, this is the image
that Mr. Futami left.

18:56.670 --> 18:59.800
It's most likely trying to
show us where he went.

19:03.710 --> 19:04.800
Over there!

19:10.550 --> 19:15.450
Meaning Futami's consciousness and
his body are totally within the network?

19:15.550 --> 19:18.680
Yeah, and he is trying
to tell us something.

19:22.160 --> 19:24.090
Night Head Project?

19:25.960 --> 19:26.760
What is it?

19:27.700 --> 19:31.190
Isn't this the list of psychic
power holders that Ark has?

19:32.540 --> 19:33.660
Reiko Hirose...

19:35.510 --> 19:38.030
Amazing. They have
everything from personal history...

19:38.110 --> 19:40.480
...to medical records and
psychoanalysis results looked up!

19:40.550 --> 19:42.100
What're these names?

19:42.480 --> 19:44.040
"Elimination target"?

19:44.220 --> 19:45.240
That's right!

19:45.320 --> 19:47.290
They're the girls that
Reiko Hirose murdered!

19:48.220 --> 19:52.020
In here, there were power holders
that this company didn't want!

19:52.590 --> 19:54.420
Then maybe...

19:56.290 --> 19:57.230
<i>Masayuki Yushima</i>

19:56.800 --> 19:57.920
There he is!

19:58.560 --> 20:01.360
Then, within the high school
kids that were killed, there was...

20:06.470 --> 20:08.130
Kamiya's name is there too.

20:08.340 --> 20:10.810
Then all the incidents
were planned here!

20:11.080 --> 20:14.140
They said Okuhara the director
has the power of foresight.

20:14.280 --> 20:17.940
They looked up the people that are
going to become a hindrance to the future.

20:18.150 --> 20:20.950
Then they brought them to their
death without them realizing it.

20:21.050 --> 20:22.820
On top of that,
they can't be judged by law.

20:24.360 --> 20:26.720
That's Ark's true character!

20:29.760 --> 20:33.290
But why weren't our names on there.

20:34.070 --> 20:35.430
We were protected.

20:35.500 --> 20:36.590
By Shouko?

20:36.670 --> 20:40.540
Yeah, and by the power that
came from where Shouko went.

20:45.340 --> 20:47.280
I beg you, help me...

20:48.110 --> 20:49.210
Futami, is that you?

20:49.710 --> 20:51.770
Protect that child.

20:52.520 --> 20:55.180
<i>I'll be waiting at the cape.</i>

20:55.720 --> 20:57.810
I'll be waiting at the cape.

21:02.560 --> 21:04.360
I brought you your tea.

21:05.260 --> 21:10.030
How nice. When did you
get the power of telepathy?

21:10.100 --> 21:11.260
No, Director...

21:11.640 --> 21:15.870
It's just a feeling that I have
learned from working in this company.

21:16.110 --> 21:18.200
You're one I can't read.

21:18.810 --> 21:22.140
You're the only one
that doesn't tire me out.

21:22.450 --> 21:24.040
You are a priceless treasure.

21:24.250 --> 21:25.220
There you go.

21:26.020 --> 21:28.710
I met my childhood self in a dream.

21:28.790 --> 21:32.310
For some reason, I was dressed
as a maiden and was at a shrine.

21:32.590 --> 21:33.920
Seems very meaningful.

21:34.490 --> 21:37.390
I was cute and pure...

21:37.900 --> 21:41.530
I'm going to get going now,
but is there anything else?

21:41.600 --> 21:43.030
A little more...

21:43.340 --> 21:46.400
When I can see a little
more about those brothers...

21:46.570 --> 21:48.560
...then we will make a move.

21:48.770 --> 21:50.970
Seriously, this affects
my body really harshly.

21:51.580 --> 21:55.030
When reality goes a different
way than the foreseen way...

21:55.110 --> 21:56.670
Uncertain data...

21:56.750 --> 21:57.410
That's right...

21:59.380 --> 22:00.940
Well, I'll be leaving now.

22:08.190 --> 22:09.290
The cape, huh?

22:31.280 --> 22:34.550
<i>An exact answer is nowhere.</i>

22:34.620 --> 22:37.210
<i>Even if you corner it, it still runs.</i>

22:37.290 --> 22:41.890
<i>It's that kind of repeating all the time.</i>

22:41.960 --> 22:45.190
<i>We hurt each other
and rip each other apart.</i>

22:45.260 --> 22:47.890
<i>We're complaining once again.</i>

22:47.970 --> 22:53.300
<i>When tomorrow comes, just like a lie,
you wear a mask and live on.</i>

22:53.370 --> 22:58.670
<i>I was wishing upon
the night stars...</i>

22:58.740 --> 23:04.010
<i>...for our distance
to become shorter.</i>

23:04.080 --> 23:10.720
<i>But if I try to bluff,
then I'm going to regret it.</i>

23:10.790 --> 23:13.260
<i>Words and feelings are reverse.</i>

23:13.330 --> 23:18.890
<i>Feelings that were asleep,
heart that was asleep, lure it out!</i>

23:18.960 --> 23:24.230
<i>Glamour that was asleep, myself
that was asleep, with your power!</i>

23:24.300 --> 23:29.760
<i>Please look at me quietly with the soul
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:29.840 --> 23:34.640
<i>I want you to go wilder inside me.</i>

23:34.710 --> 23:40.170
<i>Eyes that were asleep, emotions
that were asleep, wake them up!</i>

23:40.250 --> 23:45.520
<i>Memories that were asleep, dreams
that were asleep, with your power!</i>

23:45.590 --> 23:51.050
<i>Please melt me with the vision of kindness
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:51.130 --> 23:58.230
<i>I want to stay asleep
longer buried inside you.</i>

24:00.910 --> 24:02.240
"I'll be waiting at the cape."

24:03.170 --> 24:07.270
A brief calm that came
with the mysterious words.

24:07.980 --> 24:12.920
That is a fabricated cradle
disguised with fear and threat.

24:13.950 --> 24:17.410
The will that hides in the
darkness starts a new movement.

24:17.990 --> 24:23.090
As the man that disappeared into the sea
of symbols entrusts us with the last key...

